I won't let him take
my company apart. What?

255
00:18:49,760 --> 00:18:50,590
Kaiba!

256
00:18:52,760 --> 00:18:55,995
It looks like we have bigger
things to worry about now.

257
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:08,220
This is Valon. Go ahead.

258
00:19:08,700 --> 00:19:11,229
The Pharaoh's friends
are heading your way.

259
00:19:11,520 --> 00:19:15,049
Good, then it's time for me to
show Joey Wheeler who's boss.

260
00:19:15,140 --> 00:19:15,970
Valon, wait!

261
00:19:21,560 --> 00:19:23,680
I gotta prove meself to mine.

262
00:19:25,600 --> 00:19:27,220
Look, here comes Joey.

263
00:19:28,220 --> 00:19:29,420
And there he goes.

264
00:19:29,680 --> 00:19:30,740
Hey, come back.

265
00:19:30,920 --> 00:19:32,157
You're going the wrong way.

266
00:19:32,240 --> 00:19:34,437
He's heading straight
for the zombie patrol.

267
00:19:34,520 --> 00:19:35,991
Go warn the others, Taya.

268
00:19:36,580 --> 00:19:37,410
Tristan!

269
00:19:40,160 --> 00:19:41,680
I'm coming for you, Dots.

270
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:44,332
And I'm not leaving without Yugi and Mai.

271
00:19:51,040 --> 00:19:52,440
Thank you.
